"index_reference": "65001008",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p><span><em>glorious beings</em></span>: This likely refers to evil angels. In the Old Testament and Judaism, angels played an important role in judgment. The false teachers might have been minimizing the reality of a future judgment (see <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"65001018\" data-end-ref=\"65001018\">1:18</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61003003\" data-end-ref=\"61003004\">2&nbsp;Peter 3:3–4</data>) or denying the glorious origin of these angels who rebelled against God (compare <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61002010\" data-end-ref=\"61002010\">2&nbsp;Peter 2:10</data>).</p>",
"associations": {
