{
"content_id": "19671",
"reference_id": 18839,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Jude 1:18",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "65001018",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p><span><em>In the last times</em></span>: Jesus coming as the Messiah (God&apos;s chosen one) started the final part of God&apos;s plan. This is when Old Testament prophecies about the last days began to happen. Because of this, Jude uses the apostles&apos; prophecy about the last times to address the current crisis caused by false teachers (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"65001019\" data-end-ref=\"65001019\">1:19</data>).</p>",
