"title": "Jude 1:23",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "65001023",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<ul><li><p><span><em>save others</em></span>: Some believers were so influenced by the false teachers that they were in immediate danger of being condemned. </p></li><li><p><span><em>to still others show mercy</em></span>: This group likely includes the false teachers themselves or those who followed their teachings. Showing mercy might involve praying for them (see <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40005044\" data-end-ref=\"40005044\">Matthew 5:44</data>). </p></li><li><p>Believers must be very careful when showing mercy to false teachers and those who have adopted their sinful ways, as their sins can be tempting. See <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"38003001\" data-end-ref=\"38003004\">Zechariah 3:1–4</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66003004\" data-end-ref=\"66003004\">Revelation 3:4</data>.</p></li></ul>",
