"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Jude 1:24–25",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "65001024-65001025",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>Jude ends his letter with a powerful praise to God, often quoted during times of worship. His words are perfect for the people who received his letter. They needed a renewed understanding of God. The believers needed to remember that God was powerful enough to help them stay faithful to him. They also needed to trust that God could protect them from being convinced by false teachings. God has the glory, majesty, power, and authority to bring them safely into his glorious presence forever.</p>",
